{
  "sequence_id": "seq_cd727990f22c777b",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Wish"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "DOINK!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "All right!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I win."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "FSAH:"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "30 meters ("
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "[Goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "[GOAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I know his namesake is Tiger, but it should be more like gorilla."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "He threw it like a baseball pitch."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "All right, teach, I gotta go."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Nice throw."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Pat"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Itadori, you don't have to feel obligated to stay in the occult research club, you know?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A sports club would probably be a better fit..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Well, I've got my reasons, and I need to be home by five."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T15",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Besides, everyone needs to be in a club, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T16",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "So that's why..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T17",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You don't have to do anything! You can be like a phantom member-kinda fitting for the occult research club, huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T18",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "For real?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "besides, you guys can't even go to haunted spots without me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Even though you like scary stuff"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Shaka"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Shaka"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Shaka Suaka"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Guh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "We're scared because we like it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If it's okay with you guys, I'd like to stay."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The occult research club is really growing on me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Well, suit yourself. We don't care."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Daww"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Whoa, that's impressive. He did that without cursed energy, just natural ability!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T15",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I wonder if he's like Zenin Senpai?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T16",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I've wasted too much time watching."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T17",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ah!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T18",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Four thirty!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T19",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It's already half past four!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T20",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Gotta hurry!"
    }
  ],
